--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- NAME: Career Change Workshop Sign-up
-- Registration page for the live workshop "Thinking Clearly About Career Change"
-- (Clearer Thinking with Angel Au of Overcome). Collects an email, sends a
-- confirmation email, and records where the sign-up came from.
--
-- HOW TO USE
-- 1. Fill in the settings block below. Until the date is fixed, keep dateKnown = 0:
--    the page and the email then say the date is coming, and every sign-up is
--    still recorded. When you know it, set dateKnown = 1 and fill workshopDate and
--    workshopTime. Same pattern for the session length (lengthKnown), the join
--    link (joinLinkKnown) and the calendar link (calendarLinkKnown).
-- 2. In GuidedTrack: Settings -> Branding, set "Email display name" to
--    "Clearer Thinking" and the Reply-To address, so the confirmation email does
--    not arrive from "Career Change Workshop Sign-up".
-- 3. Share the run link with ?src=newsletter, ?src=overcome, etc. The src value is
--    saved with each sign-up so you can see which channel brought whom.
--
-- GUIDEDTRACK GOTCHAS BAKED IN HERE (verified 2026-09-14 with a scratch program)
-- - 0 and "" are TRUTHY in *if; only an undefined variable is falsy. Every flag
--   below is therefore tested with "= 1", never as a bare *if: flag.
-- - text.find returns the 1-based position, or nothing (falsy) when not found.
-- - A text line that starts with *Word:* is parsed as a keyword, so bold leads
--   are done in HTML (<b>) or with multi-word phrases only.
-- - <img> is stripped from *html, so the logo is a CSS background image (URL written
--   literally: {variable} interpolation does not run inside <style>).
-- - *html styles are cleared on every page change, so each page carries its own.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- SETTINGS (edit these) ---------------------------------------------------------
>> workshopTitle = "Thinking Clearly About Career Change"
>> workshopSubtitle = "What the evidence says, and what it can't tell you"
>> dateKnown = 1
>> workshopDate = "Wednesday, September 30"
-- Include the time zone(s) in workshopTime, e.g. "6 pm UK, 1 pm US Eastern".
>> workshopTime = "12 pm Eastern Time (9 am Pacific, 5 pm UK)"
>> lengthKnown = 0
>> workshopLength = ""
>> joinLinkKnown = 0
>> workshopJoinLink = ""
-- Calendar links (16:00 UTC start, 60-minute block; adjust if the length changes). Use + for spaces,
-- not %20: GuidedTrack re-encodes percent signs when the link goes into the email. The .ics file and
-- the facilitator photo are served from the programs.clearerthinking.org repo (career-workshop program).
>> calendarLinkKnown = 1
>> calendarLink = "https://calendar.google.com/calendar/render?action=TEMPLATE&text=Thinking+Clearly+About+Career+Change&dates=20260930T160000Z/20260930T170000Z&details=Free+live+online+workshop+from+Clearer+Thinking+with+Angel+Au+of+Overcome.+The+link+to+join+arrives+by+email.&location=Online"
>> icsLink = "https://programs.clearerthinking.org/career-workshop/thinking-clearly-about-career-change.ics"
>> facilitatorName = "Angel Au"
>> facilitatorLine = "Co-founder of Overcome, a UK-registered mental health charity, and an EMCC-accredited coach"
-- Link shown to registrants for sharing. Point the redirect at the run URL with ?src=referral so referred sign-ups stay attributed.
>> signupUrl = "https://programs.clearerthinking.org/career-workshop"
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- Tracking parameter from the run URL (?src=newsletter). Empty when absent.
*if: not src
	>> src = ""

-- Derived text used on the page and in the email.
>> whenText = "Date and time coming soon. Sign up and we'll email you as soon as it's fixed."
*if: dateKnown = 1
	>> whenText = "{workshopDate}, {workshopTime}"

*settings
	*menu: no
	*back: yes

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- PAGE 1: the invitation
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*html
	<style>
		.program_container .main { max-width: 640px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; padding-top: 28px; padding-bottom: 96px; }
		@media (max-width: 767px) { .program_container .main { padding-top: 64px; padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px; } }
		.program_container p { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; color: #2a2a2a; font-weight: 400; margin: 0 0 14px 0; }
		.program_container a { color: #0A6FD6; text-decoration: underline; overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: break-word; }
		.program_container .btn { background-color: #0885F8; border: none; border-radius: 8px; padding: 15px 30px; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; }
		.program_container .btn:hover, .program_container .btn:focus { background-color: #0A6FD6; border: none; color: #fff; }
		.program_container .btn:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #0A6FD6; outline-offset: 3px; }
		@media (min-width: 600px) { .program_container .btn.btn-block { display: inline-block; width: auto; min-width: 300px; } }
		.program_container .ct-brandrow { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin: 0 0 22px 0; }
		.program_container .ct-logo { display: inline-block; width: 30px; height: 30px; background-image: url("https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,onerror=redirect/uploads/publication/logo/d0ed5a5f-0bca-4054-ab2c-73fd51707f71/Logo-01.png"); background-size: contain; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: center; }
		.program_container .ct-wordmark { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #1a1a1a; letter-spacing: 0.01em; }
		.program_container:has(#ct-logo) .ct-brandrow { display: none; }
		.program_container h1.ct-title { color: #1a1a1a !important; font-size: 30px !important; line-height: 1.2 !important; font-weight: 700 !important; letter-spacing: -0.01em; margin: 0 0 10px 0 !important; }
		.program_container h2.ct-h2 { color: #1a1a1a !important; font-size: 21px !important; line-height: 1.3 !important; font-weight: 700 !important; margin: 40px 0 10px 0 !important; }
		.program_container p.ct-sub { color: #5b6472; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.4; margin: 0 0 22px 0; }
		.program_container p.ct-fine, .program_container .ct-bio p.ct-fine { color: #6b7380; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; font-style: normal; margin: 10px 0 0 0; }
		.program_container .ct-facts { border: 1px solid #dfe6f0 !important; border-radius: 10px !important; box-shadow: none !important; background: #f4f8fd !important; padding: 16px 20px !important; margin: 0 0 24px 0 !important; }
		.program_container .ct-facts p { margin: 3px 0; font-size: 16px; }
		.program_container .ct-facts b { color: #1a1a1a; }
		.program_container ul.ct-list { padding-left: 22px; margin: 0 0 8px 0; }
		.program_container ul.ct-list li { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; color: #2a2a2a; margin-bottom: 10px; }
		.program_container ul.ct-list li b { color: #1a1a1a; }
		@media (max-width: 480px) { .program_container h1.ct-title { font-size: 28px !important; } .program_container p.ct-sub { font-size: 18px; } }
		
		.program_container p.ct-eyebrow { color: #0A6FD6; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.3; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 0 10px 0; }
		.program_container h1.ct-title.ct-hero { font-size: 34px !important; }
		.program_container .ct-facts p.ct-skip { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 15px; }
		.program_container .ct-facts p.ct-skip a { display: inline-block; padding: 6px 0; }
		.program_container .ct-bio { border: 1px solid #dfe6f0 !important; border-radius: 10px !important; box-shadow: none !important; background: #ffffff !important; padding: 18px 20px !important; margin: 10px 0 28px 0 !important; }
		.program_container .ct-bio p { margin: 4px 0; font-size: 16px; }
		.program_container .ct-bio-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 128px 1fr; column-gap: 24px; row-gap: 0; align-items: start; }
		.program_container .ct-avatar { grid-row: 1 / 4; width: 128px; height: 160px; border-radius: 10px; background-color: #e9eef5; background-image: url("https://programs.clearerthinking.org/career-workshop/angel-au.jpg"); background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: auto 150%; background-position: 50% 25%; }
		.program_container .ct-bio p.ct-name { grid-column: 2; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 2px 0; }
		.program_container .ct-bio p.ct-role { grid-column: 2; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.45; color: #5b6472; margin: 0 0 10px 0; }
		.program_container .ct-bio p.ct-bio-para { grid-column: 2; margin: 0; }
		@media (max-width: 480px) { .program_container .ct-bio-row { grid-template-columns: 96px 1fr; column-gap: 16px; } .program_container .ct-avatar { grid-row: 1 / 3; width: 96px; height: 120px; } .program_container .ct-bio p.ct-name { align-self: end; } .program_container .ct-bio p.ct-role { align-self: start; margin: 0; } .program_container .ct-bio p.ct-bio-para { grid-column: 1 / -1; margin-top: 14px; } }
	</style>

*html
	<div class="ct-brandrow"><span class="ct-logo"></span><span class="ct-wordmark">Clearer Thinking</span></div>
	<p class="ct-eyebrow">Free live workshop, with Overcome</p>
	<h1 class="ct-title ct-hero">{workshopTitle}</h1>
	<p class="ct-sub">{workshopSubtitle}</p>

*component
	*classes: ct-facts
	*html
		<p><b>When:</b> {whenText}</p>
		<p><b>Where:</b> Online, live. We'll email the link to join before the session.</p>
	*if: lengthKnown = 1
		*html
			<p><b>Length:</b> {workshopLength}</p>
	*html
		<p><b>Cost:</b> Free</p>
		<p class="ct-skip"><a href="#ct-signup">Sign up now</a></p>

*html
	<p>In early September we asked newsletter readers where they stood with their careers. Hundreds of people answered. Most were thinking about, planning, or making a career change. When we asked about the single biggest obstacle, the most common answer, ahead of money, confidence, and age, was some version of <b>"I don't know which path fits me."</b></p>
	<p>This workshop is our response. It covers what the research on career change shows, where that research runs out, and how to work through the obstacles readers raised.</p>
	<h2 class="ct-h2">What we'll cover</h2>
	<ul class="ct-list">
		<li>What the evidence says about finding a career that fits.</li>
		<li>What predicts a career change going well.</li>
		<li>How to navigate common obstacles such as too many plausible options, transition costs, and a job market unsettled by AI.</li>
	</ul>

*html
	<h2 class="ct-h2">Who it's for</h2>

People who are considering, planning, or already making a career change and want to think it through carefully. If you're choosing a first career, you're welcome too: much of the evidence applies, even if the constraints differ.

*html
	<h2 class="ct-h2">Who's leading it</h2>

*component
	*classes: ct-bio
	*html
		<div class="ct-bio-row">
			<span class="ct-avatar" role="img" aria-label="Photo of Angel Au"></span>
			<p class="ct-name"><b>{facilitatorName}</b></p>
			<p class="ct-role">{facilitatorLine}</p>
			<p class="ct-bio-para">Overcome has provided free one-to-one coaching to more than 2,700 people since 2023, and Angel's career coaching has helped people into training places in counseling and applied psychology.</p>
		</div>

Sign up below. You'll get a confirmation email right away and the link to join before the session. If you can't make it live, sign up anyway: we plan to record it and send the recording to everyone who registered.

*html
	<div id="ct-signup"></div>

*button: Sign up

