*html
	<div class="ct-brandrow"><span class="ct-logo"></span><span class="ct-wordmark">Clearer Thinking</span></div>
	<h1 class="ct-title">You're registered{headingName}.</h1>

A confirmation is on its way to {signupEmail}. If it isn't there in a few minutes, check your spam folder and mark it as not spam so the link to join doesn't end up there too.

*component
	*classes: ct-facts
	*html
		<p><b>Workshop:</b> {workshopTitle}</p>
		<p><b>When:</b> {whenText}</p>
		<p><b>Where:</b> Online, live. We'll email the link to join before the session.</p>

*if: dateKnown = 1
	*if: calendarLinkKnown = 1
		*html
			<p>Add it to your own calendar now so it doesn't slip: <a href="{calendarLink}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Calendar</a>, or <a href="{icsLink}">download the .ics file</a> for Apple Calendar, Outlook and others.</p>

*html
	<h2 class="ct-h2">What happens next</h2>
	<ul class="ct-list">
		<li><b>Before the session:</b> we'll send you the link to join 24 hours before the event starts, and add you to the event's Google Calendar invite.</li>
		<li><b>Afterward:</b> we plan to send the recording to everyone who registered, though by watching the recording you won't be able to interact or ask questions.</li>
	</ul>
	<h2 class="ct-h2">In the meantime</h2>
	<p>If you sent a question, thank you. We pass them all to Angel before the session. And if you know someone partway through the same decision, send them the sign-up link below. Judging by the survey, many readers are.</p>
	<p class="ct-share"><a href="{signupUrl}">{signupUrl}</a></p>
	<p class="ct-fine">Clearer Thinking is a not-for-profit project. The workshop is free.</p>
